Package: autoslider.trade
Title: Slide Automation for Trading Tables, Listings and Figures
Version: 0.0.0.9004
Authors@R: 
    person("Joe", "Zhu", , "sha.joe.zhu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A downstream package of `autoslider.core` that produces
    tables, listings and figures for finance trading, in the same style as
    `autoslider`. Where `autoslider.core` automates clinical study outputs
    from CDISC data, this package automates trading outputs from price and
    trade data: performance tables, equity curves and trade listings. The
    instruments these outputs are computed on are selected by
    `filters.trade`.
License: Apache License (>= 2.0)
